# Filtering by name, and showing only some file types.
Output out/filter.gif
Source tapes/_setup.tape

Type "dfdu"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "/"
Sleep 300ms
Type "do"
Sleep 1.5s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
Type "t"
Sleep 1s
Type "video"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Screenshot out/filter.png
Sleep 300ms
Type "q"
Sleep 300ms
